          500,
          955,
          690
        ]
      ],
      "en": "Let $A\\in\\mathcal{L}(X,Y)$. We say that $A$ is \\emph{bounded below} on a subspace $M\\subset X$ if there exists a constant $k>0$ such that\\[\\|Ax\\|\\geq k\\|x\\|,\\quad\\text{for all }x\\in M.\\]Let $(\\mathcal{D}(A),A)$ be an operator from $H$ to $H$. Show that if $A$ is closed and bounded below on $\\mathcal{N}(A)^\\perp\\cap\\mathcal{D}(A)$, then $\\mathcal{R}(A)$ is closed.",
      "zh": "设 $A\\in\\mathcal{L}(X,Y)$. 若存在常数 $k>0$, 使得\\[\\|Ax\\|\\geq k\\|x\\|,\\quad\\text{for all }x\\in M.\\]则称 $A$ 在子空间 $M\\subset X$ 上\\emph{有下界}. 设 $(\\mathcal{D}(A),A)$ 是从 $H$ 到 $H$ 的算子. 证明, 若 $A$ 是闭的且在 $\\mathcal{N}(A)^\\perp\\cap\\mathcal{D}(A)$ 上有下界, 则 $\\mathcal{R}(A)$ 是闭的.",
      "label": "ex:closed-bounded-below-operator-closed-range",
